<title>FINLAND: TABLE - FINNISH SAVINGS BANKS H1 OP PROFIT RISES.</title>
<headline>TABLE - FINNISH SAVINGS BANKS H1 OP PROFIT RISES.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to end-June,</p>
<p>				    (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Operating profit after credit losses	 149 vs 110</p>
<p> Loan and guarantee losses			 33 vs 36</p>
<p> Net income from financial operations	 420 vs 392</p>
<p> Capital adequacy (BIS), percent	     14.7 vs 12.6</p>
<p>NOTE - Results cover 40 independent Finnish savings banks.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
